            {
                "caption": "December 14, 2012, Deepak managed A D directly",
                "text": "A D Sao, is a man of immense knowledge. His experience in the line of Industrial Explosive is unsurpassed. Over the years, with hands on exposure to manufacturing, site management, product development excersise, coupled with his expertise in the field of developing and maintaining Client relationship make him a man of High repute in the field of Industrial Explosives.\r\n\r\nCapability to understand colleagues, identify and sharpen their strengths and at the same time identify the challenges they face, thereby guiding them through the various phases of development, make  A D Sao, a respected team leader.\r\n\r\nNever a person to shrink from responsibilities, A D Sao is known to understand market dynamics well before they are formed. His deep insight of the business, makes it easy for him to plan and stay ahead of competition at any given time. \r\n\r\nI wish ADS, all the best and I am sure, he will continue surpassing all expectations!\r\n\r\nDeepak Korpal",
